*** Begin ECU Patch
Key: 014-sandbox-runtime-db-adapter
Title: Resolve scoped Sandbox database handles
Purpose: Make Sandbox actions work with both EkairosRuntime db() and already-resolved runtime database handles.

*** Begin Context
The real Workbench bootstrap exposed an adapter mismatch: Sandbox action steps treated runtime.db as a property while EkairosRuntime exposes an async db() method. A single resolver now normalizes both supported runtime shapes before Sandbox service access, with focused tests covering each shape.
*** End Context

